 "key_insight": "RSPCA's fetched pages are generic puppy-buying and anti-puppy-farm advice that never name the breed and carry no schema, yet the registry has it ranking for Staffy buying and price searches — so its pull is domain authority, not breed content. BSUK can beat it on intent with a Staffy-specific responsible-buying and price guide that answers the same welfare checks for this breed."
